{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>秀茂坪發生車禍。今日（12日）6時20分，正值上班返學繁忙時段，一輛密斗貨車沿寶琳路上斜，右轉入寶達商場時，一輛雙層九巴正沿寶琳路下斜，兩車繼</p><p>據了解，警方正調查車禍原因，不持除有人衝燈或看錯燈號。</p><p>根據網上圖片和影片，貨車在現場馬路黃色方格路口翻側，左邊車身損毀，九巴停在旁邊，車頭車門位置嚴重損毀，其他司機表示「炒車」、「無路行」、「成條路塞晒」。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772703259660288731468.jpeg/UNPqKwU0tB9Qt0sYjD-O11TA3fcunNog651u2Oudbtg\" alt=\"九巴車頭擋風玻璃碎裂。\"><figcaption>九巴車頭擋風玻璃碎裂。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772564608552960408129.jpeg/4bU6IbTHsNlN4jDl7zRAvG2ebG6v4CZ80AgRqtAIEao\" alt=\"10名傷者在場等候治理。(陳永武攝）\"><figcaption>10名傷者在場等候治理。(陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772568849125376874213.jpeg/0IuGCKMPL_E_gCAlDDuOac0MdrjJBsruF_DbYhfw22I\" alt=\"10名傷者在場等候治理。\"><figcaption>10名傷者在場等候治理。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772573366521856107246.jpeg/cmgdn69ruhwIcXzPLvaay1h1yRg4MHNd6-GWc-vhlnM\" alt=\"有傷者由擔架床送院救治。\"><figcaption>有傷者由擔架床送院救治。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772577506430976041762.jpeg/I31ttEBXQLL4rLLVZ-coUMflNa6AxBWIk_UW2ZP1Ftk\" alt=\"有傷者由擔架床送院救治。\"><figcaption>有傷者由擔架床送院救治。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772581461790720164075.jpeg/OwN94zIe1mi0-ZdhaWVMFVYOq5VR9JMNTBRfi0wUX4s\" alt=\"有傷者由擔架床送院救治。\"><figcaption>有傷者由擔架床送院救治。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772545323143168083762.jpeg/YY-iVK5NogrtIBziuUTktWvwb29uqcDcfy9NcH8vTXA\" alt=\"有傷者由擔架床送院救治。\"><figcaption>有傷者由擔架床送院救治。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130772549504995328461753.jpeg/oSSCQlcQ0bVzdA0-eGAnQ0VV6cHhKdcZM9ZHgjPWR4I\" alt=\"巴士車頭盡毀。\"><figcaption>巴士車頭盡毀。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130762426694766592905382.jpeg/G2S1yym374D6drCiByUJZQNZvEt4SEFxFF7dgxRe3YM\" alt=\"貨車在現場馬路黃色方格路口翻側，九巴停在旁邊。（網上圖片）\"><figcaption>貨車在現場馬路黃色方格路口翻側，九巴停在旁邊。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130762429379252224894172.jpeg/5Z986gXiAP0yfqb7nEEcWtjbc-7oHm-uKZCLgymQi4M\" alt=\"九巴車頭車門位置嚴重損毀。（網上圖片）\"><figcaption>九巴車頭車門位置嚴重損毀。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130766779203719168940186.jpeg/yenFz4DTN1bxcgA3qEmEf_albDYrSz5rZ7WsK121rCs\" alt=\"貨車司機等候治理。\"><figcaption>貨車司機等候治理。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130766951044354048059412.jpeg/3tqA84ae1nB1SFwPpz_hhqbZx6QoZhU03r8_V-S_P1c\" alt=\"九巴司機受傷。\"><figcaption>九巴司機受傷。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-11T23:41:15.435330+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}